The full Numbas pack, `PhysLab Question Pack.pqjson`, holds 50 questions: the 22 above, exactly as
the app ships them, and 28 more gathered the same way (university-level, course-specific and
non-English items). It ships as a separate file beside the installer, with its own NOTICE listing
every question and every change, and is never bundled inside the app. It is a selection, not
every question the harvest found: of the 222 licence-cleared questions, 92 carry a broken Numbas
placeholder and most of the rest are duplicate copies or Numbas's own demonstration items.
